.dockerignore
.git
**/Dockerfile
**/node_modules
**/build
**/.svelte-kit
# Personal build settings; pass VITE_* as build args instead.
**/.env
**/.env.*
**/__pycache__
data
# Agent worktrees and local tool state
.claude
# One deployment's private settings (deploy.sh doesn't send them, a build from a checkout would)
local
CLAUDE.local.md
# Written by deploy.sh and ebook-update; a new one mustn't invalidate the build cache
.version
# VNBox fetched for pnpm dev; the image fetches its own (scripts/vnbox/build.sh)
apps/web/static/vn/vnbox
# The desktop and Android apps are built on their own, never in the images
apps/desktop
apps/android
# Engine tests (the difficulty image copies engine/ whole)
engine/tests
